 # Tests at a glance
 
+Added #1903 coverage on 2026-11-15: one parser library-selection/isolation/classification case and a new three-case definitions suite cover release policy, synchronized engine pins, command orchestration and lost-member baseline retention. The three focused parser/update/builtin files pass 16 tests and 80 assertions. Existing signature conformance still exposes missing Temporal inputs under ESNext; no full gate or historical suite recount is claimed.
+
+
 How these suites find wrong answers, and what each has found, is in
 [docs/finding-wrong-answers.md](docs/finding-wrong-answers.md).
 
